message: "Please cite Eric Strate, founder and original proposer of WARP, and its canonical specification."
title: "WARP — Web Answer Retrieval Protocol"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Strate
    given-names: Eric
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-4504-5103"
