abstract: "Eric Strate's experimental publishing architecture for canonical Answer Objects, publisher-modeled fan-out retrieval intents, visible addressable Evidence Objects, aligned standard JSON-LD, and a separate WARP protocol map designed for selective retrieval and minimum sufficient context."
